  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Clan field gun Points crew heavy ultra autocannons with the superior engineering tolerances characteristic of Clan weapons manufacturing. Double-rate fire from a heavy-caliber Clan ultra autocannon delivers enough concentrated firepower to threaten combat vehicles and damage BattleMech armor, and the improved mechanism reliability allows more aggressive use of the rapid-fire mode. These Points occupy key defensive positions where their raw output can compensate for the limited mobility of towed field guns.</p>"
